{"publicId":"a30e3294-72a1-40c4-94ac-a0c63591af12","title":"礼来多巴胺药物mevidalen阿尔茨海默病二期试验失败","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T16:22:48.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T16:22:48.000Z","digest":"礼来公司多巴胺药物mevidalen在针对轻中度阿尔茨海默病患者的二期临床试验中未能达到主要终点【新】。该试验是礼来继2024年终止同类多巴胺药物研发后，在神经退行性疾病领域的新尝试。目前尚无公开数据说明具体失败原因或替代方案进展，但结果可能影响礼来未来阿尔茨海默病药物管线布局。\n\n该试验主要终点未披露，但根据礼来2025年研发管线披露，mevidalen原计划通过调节多巴胺系统延缓认知衰退。此前2024年终止的同类药物研发项目曾因未达安全性和有效性指标被搁置【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T17:09:32.174Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Lilly 的多巴胺药物 mevidalen 在阿尔茨海默病二期临床试验中失败","latestReport":{"id":"r0gcfksvec0tzypimeqj08qa9"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f7n1Ntr-hHDo","title":"Lilly’s dopamine drug mevidalen fails Phase 2 study in Alzhe","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T16:22:48.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"r0gcfksvec0tzypimeqj08qa9","title":"Lilly 的多巴胺药物 mevidalen 在阿尔茨海默病二期临床试验中失败","summary":"Lilly 的多巴胺药物 mevidalen 在针对轻中度阿尔茨海默病患者的二期临床试验中未能达到主要终点。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T16:22:48.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"r0gcfksvec0tzypimeqj08qa9","title":"Lilly 的多巴胺药物 mevidalen 在阿尔茨海默病二期临床试验中失败","summary":"Lilly 的多巴胺药物 mevidalen 在针对轻中度阿尔茨海默病患者的二期临床试验中未能达到主要终点。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T16:22:48.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T01:00:00.000Z"